{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcThe Chime that Shattered the Routine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's blissful days as a &quot;Home Security Guard&quot; (a self-proclaimed title for a shut-in) come to an abrupt end when he receives a devastating declaration: his mother is cutting off his financial support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a ring of the doorbell, various visitors arrive at his apartment door. The man's fate is determined entirely by your choice to either <strong>&quot;Interact&quot;</strong> with or <strong>&quot;Ignore&quot;</strong> them. Will he be able to protect his peaceful, reclusive life? Or does a different fate await him...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867600/extras/ff569cdaebb318ac24cb925e33858328.avif?t=1764901893\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcVisitors with Heavy Baggage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of people will appear at your door: a drunken woman, a man searching for his lost pet bird, a neighbor suffering from domestic abuse, and more. The story unfolds as you dare to involve yourself with these odd, eccentric, and sometimes dangerous visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867600/extras/c2da33b8b544ece7580f254bc4a6a095.avif?t=1764901893\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867600/extras/994079aefcca87c2e47f3ce52437f510.avif?t=1764901893\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, be extremely wary of who you let in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams